-  Auto scale: ON (dpi: 96, min: 1.000, max: 888.000)
+  Auto scale: OFF (dpi: 96, min: 1.000, max: 888.000)
   Round scales to: 0.25, NEAREST
   Disabled:
     !^eDP-[0-9]
