+++ b/tst/cfg-file/reload-invalid-file.log
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@ Reloading configuration file: file_path
 Configuration unchanged:
   Arrange in a ROW aligned at the TOP
   Scaling: ON
-  Auto scale: ON (dpi: 96, min: 1.000, max: 111.000)
+  Auto scale: OFF (dpi: 96, min: 1.000, max: 111.000)
   Round scales to: 0.125, NEAREST
   Disabled:
     !^eDP-[0-9]
