 ipc request: invalid SCALE_ROUND_STRATEGY BAD_SCALE_ROUND_STRATEGY, expected enum NEAREST|UP|DOWN, using default NEAREST
-ipc request: invalid AUTO_SCALE BAD_AUTO_SCALE, expected boolean, using default true
+ipc request: invalid AUTO_SCALE BAD_AUTO_SCALE, expected boolean, using default false
 ipc request: invalid AUTO_SCALE_DPI BAD_AUTO_SCALE_DPI, expected integer, using default 96
 ipc request: invalid AUTO_SCALE_MIN BAD_AUTO_SCALE_MIN, expected number, using default 1.0
 ipc request: invalid AUTO_SCALE_MAX BAD_AUTO_SCALE_MAX, expected number, using default -1.0
